put"><value>EVA-upper platform clogs with closed toes, vent openings and a visible pivot strap. The sculpted platform silhouette is shown in the actual product photographs. Choose Blue, Khaki, Beige, Light Pink or Black and three paired size labels: 35-36, 37-38 and 39-40. Separate lining, midsole and ground-contact outsole materials are not specified. Send colour-size quantities, fit requirements and destination to confirm order details.</value></field><field id="companyDesc" type="input"><value>Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear &amp; Apparel Co., Ltd. supports footwear development and wholesale inquiries. The company capability images below describe general business capabilities. Product-specific availability, samples, customization, packing and dispatch are assessed against your order requirements before quotation.</value></field><field id="companyFaqDesc" type="multiComplex"><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Which materials are confirmed?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>The upper is EVA. Separate lining, midsole and ground-contact outsole formulations are not specified. Send any material requirements for confirmation before order.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Which colours and sizes can I request?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Blue, Khaki, Beige, Light Pink and Black. Size choices are the three paired labels 35-36, 37-38 and 39-40. Send your size mix and fit requirements; US or UK size conversions are confirmed separately.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>What are the MOQ and reference price tiers?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>MOQ is 2 pairs. Reference price is USD 5.16 for 2-49 pairs, USD 4.81 for 50-99 pairs and USD 4.47 for 100 pairs or more. Freight and final order terms are confirmed separately.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>How do I check fit and strap requirements?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>The pictures show the pivot strap in its forward position. Share your fit measurements and intended use so size selection and strap requirements can be confirmed for your order.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>Can I request samples or custom packaging?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Send your sample quantity, branding and packing requirements. Feasibility, charges, minimum quantities and timing are assessed before quotation.</value></field></complex-values><complex-values><field id="question" type="input"><value>How are availability and dispatch confirmed?</value></field><field id="answers" type="input"><value>Send colour-size quantities, destination and required date. Availability, packing, freight options and dispatch timing are confirmed against the agreed order.</value></field></complex-values></field></itemSchema>